    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msub><mfenced><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mfenced><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mfenced><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac></mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mn>340</mn><mn>170</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>55</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>27</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mn>1</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>For zero order reaction half life is directly proportional to the initial concentration.</p>",
